## 7. React代码转换指南

### 7.1 基本转换规则

- React的JSX需转换为Vue的模板语法
- React的useState转换为Vue的ref/reactive
- React的useEffect转换为Vue的watchEffect/onMounted
- React的useContext转换为Vue的provide/inject
- React的自定义hooks转换为Vue的组合式函数
- React的事件处理转换为Vue的事件系统
- React的条件渲染转换为Vue的v-if/v-for

### 7.2 React-Konva转Vue-Konva

| React-Konva | Vue-Konva |
|-------------|-----------|
| `<Stage>` | `<v-stage>` |
| `<Layer>` | `<v-layer>` |
| `<Rect>` | `<v-rect>` |
| `props={{...}}` | `:config="{...}"` |
| `onDragEnd={handler}` | `@dragend="handler"` |
| `useRef()` | `ref()` |
| `useState([])` | `ref([])` |
| `ref.current` | `ref.value` |

### 7.3 示例转换

**React版本:**
```jsx
function WindowFrame({ width, height }) {
  const [pos, setPos] = useState({ x: 0, y: 0 });
  const rectRef = useRef(null);
  
  const handleDragEnd = () => {
    const node = rectRef.current;
    if (node) {
      setPos({
        x: node.x(),
        y: node.y()
      });
    }
  };
  
  return (
    <Group>
      <Rect
        ref={rectRef}
        x={pos.x}
        y={pos.y}
        width={width}
        height={height}
        fill="white"
        stroke="black"
        strokeWidth={2}
        draggable
        onDragEnd={handleDragEnd}
      />
    </Group>
  );
}
```

**Vue版本:**
```vue
<script setup>
import { ref } from 'vue';

const props = defineProps({
  width: { type: Number, required: true },
  height: { type: Number, required: true }
});

const pos = ref({ x: 0, y: 0 });
const rectRef = ref(null);

const rectConfig = computed(() => ({
  x: pos.value.x,
  y: pos.value.y,
  width: props.width,
  height: props.height,
  fill: 'white',
  stroke: 'black',
  strokeWidth: 2,
  draggable: true
}));

const handleDragEnd = () => {
  const node = rectRef.value;
  if (node) {
    pos.value = {
      x: node.x(),
      y: node.y()
    };
  }
};
</script>

<template>
  <v-group>
    <v-rect
      ref="rectRef"
      :config="rectConfig"
      @dragend="handleDragEnd"
    />
  </v-group>
</template>
```

